[REQUIREMENT]
UID: IRS004
TITLE: Intra-airport log command for a single clearance decision
STATEMENT: >>>
The intra-airport interface shall submit one clearance decision as one log command containing the aircraft identity, the kind, and the runway when the kind uses a runway. Members shall apply a committed command at the same index to the same previous state. Acceptance is two members that apply one landing command and report the same resulting occupancy.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
The replicated command is the unit of authority inside the airport.
<<<
DAL: A
REQUIREMENT_LEVEL: Interface
VERIFICATION: PropEr
ASSUMPTIONS: Raft is assumed to deliver one ordered log and is not re-proved.
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: SSS009
